# .CSVmd — Ethical Trust File
# AuditorContent Module: 16 Auditor Codes
# Games of Life and Treatments of Man
#
code,domain,principle,weight
01,Integrity,Honest dealing in all financial transactions,1.0
02,Fairness,Equal treatment regardless of station or wealth,1.0
03,Transparency,Open disclosure of terms and conditions to all parties,1.0
04,Accountability,Personal responsibility for actions and their consequences,1.0
05,Compassion,Consideration for hardship and human circumstance,1.0
06,Diligence,Thorough review before judgment or settlement,1.0
07,Impartiality,No favoritism in adjudication of disputes,1.0
08,Stewardship,Careful guardianship of entrusted resources,1.0
09,Restitution,Fair restoration when harm has been done,1.0
10,Temperance,Measured response proportional to offense,1.0
11,Fidelity,Loyalty to agreements once made in good faith,1.0
12,Prudence,Wisdom in counsel before action is taken,1.0
13,Charity,Grace extended where strict law might deny,1.0
14,Fortitude,Courage to enforce right against powerful opposition,1.0
15,Dignity,Preservation of human worth in all proceedings,1.0
16,Finality,Decisive closure so that life may continue forward,1.0
